==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Uniform Motion|25}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 18.67 seconds<sup>560f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Wicked Face]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

